# qnc_v4 broadcast player freeze

Broadcast player code is frozen by default.

Do not edit these paths unless the user explicitly says "odmrznuti broadcast player":

- `qnc-broadcast-player/**`
- `qnc-media-ffmpeg/**`
- `qnc-player-output/**`
- `qnc-player-monitor/**`
- `qnc-player-monitor-bridge/**`
- `qnc-player-runtime/**`
- `qnc-player-runner/**`
- `qnc-app/src/player_remote.rs`
- `qnc-app/src/player_bridge.rs`
- `qnc-app/src/qnc_broadcast_player.rs`
- `qnc-app/scripts/test-broadcast-player*.ps1`

The archived old player code under `archive/orphan-broadcast-2026-08-01/**`
is read-only reference material. Do not copy it back into active source.

Allowed without unfreeze:

- read-only audit
- running tests
- documentation that does not change code behavior

